      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `summarize_text.py` that calls a hosted LLM to summarize long text, I need to choose a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service, which provides access to various LLMs. The code will import the necessary client from the Boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, and make a call to the Amazon Bedrock service to summarize the text. </thinking>\n",
